00:50:05.829 --> 00:50:09.746
The R.V. show is like
motor homes and trailers,

00:50:10.818 --> 00:50:12.237
all the the country stuff,

00:50:12.237 --> 00:50:15.111
and then sex show is
obviously totally different.

00:50:15.111 --> 00:50:18.778
And honestly we didn't
enjoy either of them.

00:50:20.302 --> 00:50:21.135
It was okay.

00:50:21.135 --> 00:50:22.073
We enjoyed the company.

00:50:22.073 --> 00:50:23.044
We enjoyed each other.

00:50:23.044 --> 00:50:24.764
We enjoyed watching the things,

00:50:24.764 --> 00:50:27.940
and going into the R.V.
and learning something new,

00:50:27.940 --> 00:50:29.940
but we wouldn't go back.

00:50:30.946 --> 00:50:32.613
But we went to both,

00:50:34.459 --> 00:50:37.085
where a lot of people are so fixated on,

00:50:37.085 --> 00:50:39.002
this is my life, right,

00:50:40.036 --> 00:50:41.034
you did the head banging thing,

00:50:41.034 --> 00:50:41.867
this is my life,

00:50:41.867 --> 00:50:43.904
and that's the lane I'm always
going to stay in forever.

00:50:43.904 --> 00:50:44.990
I'm never going to explore anything.

00:50:44.990 --> 00:50:47.834
So someone invites you to the R.V. show,

00:50:47.834 --> 00:50:49.167
try it, say yes.

00:50:50.685 --> 00:50:51.975
See what happens.

00:50:51.975 --> 00:50:54.339
Someone invites you to the sex show,

00:50:54.339 --> 00:50:55.547
see what happens.

