00:50:58.867 --> 00:51:02.950
but most of the things in
life aren't that scary.

00:51:03.841 --> 00:51:05.841
So at least so you know.

00:51:08.405 --> 00:51:10.586
Maybe I go to the R.V. show and I love it.

00:51:10.586 --> 00:51:13.433
Maybe I become obsessed with this R.V. and

00:51:13.433 --> 00:51:16.048
now I want to drive across
