00:51:20.669 --> 00:51:22.683
That could be a whole new business thing.

00:51:22.683 --> 00:51:25.897
I wouldn't have known unless
I went to the R.V. show.

00:51:25.897 --> 00:51:27.281
- Absolutely, I love that.

00:51:27.281 --> 00:51:28.668
I absolutely love that.

00:51:28.668 --> 00:51:31.189
And I love what you said
about making decisions

00:51:31.189 --> 00:51:32.381
with you heart,

00:51:32.381 --> 00:51:35.692
