had, it comes back to this.

00:51:45.974 --> 00:51:47.867
What is that word?

00:51:47.867 --> 00:51:50.428
What is that core value
that is driving you,

00:51:50.428 --> 00:51:52.328
and given that you're
saying make your decisions

00:51:52.328 --> 00:51:55.303
with your heart, that
connects to that core value.

00:51:55.303 --> 00:51:57.520
So I highly recommend
whoever's listening to this,

00:51:57.520 --> 00:51:59.831
is to grab Evan's book, Your One Word,

00:51:59.831 --> 00:52:01.625
and have a read through it,

00:52:01.625 --> 00:52:03.403
