00:53:34.409 --> 00:53:38.218
so I've been barefoot this whole time too.

00:53:38.218 --> 00:53:39.290
And I started small.

00:53:39.290 --> 00:53:40.123
I always like, test,

00:53:40.123 --> 00:53:41.287
here's the thing, right,

00:53:41.287 --> 00:53:42.392
stand up desk.

00:53:42.392 --> 00:53:43.795
Oh, I need to go get a stand up desk.

