that you never get to.

00:53:52.808 --> 00:53:54.138
I took my laptop,

00:53:54.138 --> 00:53:55.646
and I took a bookcase,

00:53:55.646 --> 00:53:58.612
and I just started
working from the bookcase.

00:53:58.612 --> 00:53:59.863
That's it, just experiment.

00:53:59.863 --> 00:54:00.731
Try it.

00:54:00.731 --> 00:54:01.712
Like, I'm going to try
something right now.

00:54:01.712 --> 00:54:04.074
Okay, let's get my laptop and
go work from the bookcase.

00:54:04.074 --> 00:54:05.806
Was the exact ergonomic height?

00:54:05.806 --> 00:54:06.995
No.

00:54:06.995 --> 00:54:07.828
Could it have been better?

00:54:07.828 --> 00:54:08.706
100%.

00:54:08.706 --> 00:54:12.504
I got tired after an hour of standing up,

00:54:12.504 --> 00:54:14.671
'cause I'm not used to it.

00:54:16.115 --> 00:54:17.365
And I liked it.

00:54:18.974 --> 00:54:21.706
It was one small test on one day.

00:54:21.706 --> 00:54:23.202
Like going to the R.V. show

00:54:23.202 --> 00:54:26.070
