00:54:30.068 --> 00:54:31.440
Like, you never know.

00:54:31.440 --> 00:54:33.815
And so, my back doesn't hurt anymore.

00:54:33.815 --> 00:54:35.646
My knees don't hurt anymore.

00:54:35.646 --> 00:54:39.252
That was the most immediate
health benefit that I got.

00:54:39.252 --> 00:54:43.168
I also find that I have more
energy when I'm standing up.

00:54:43.168 --> 00:54:44.001
When I did phone calls,

00:54:44.001 --> 00:54:45.519
