00:55:34.559 --> 00:55:35.392
- Ha.

00:55:35.392 --> 00:55:37.523
- But the audiobook was fire.

00:55:37.523 --> 00:55:38.695
The audiobook was amazing.

00:55:38.695 --> 00:55:40.422
It was so much better
because I could stand up.

00:55:40.422 --> 00:55:41.255
And doing this,

00:55:41.255 --> 00:55:42.505
